        "Before paying, use the site's product-link checklist to confirm that the destination still matches the saved find. Before international shipping, use the category checklist to define visible QC and the shipping-cost guide to plan the second payment. The clean sequence is keyword intent, comparable candidates, exact source, selected option and warehouse evidence. CSSBuy keyword search is valuable when it narrows uncertainty; it is not a substitute for verifying the listing that ultimately enters the cart."
